The 'game-client' folder contains all frontend assets and configuration for the Shattered Archive game's web-based client application. It houses the main entry point (index.html), React project setup with TypeScript configuration (tsconfig.json, package.json), and Vite build configuration (vite.config.ts) that together form the interactive game interface users will engage with. The folder also includes a separate status page (status.html) for monitoring client health and connectivity.
